      "content": "That's a good start. I really want to lean into that contrast between the \"civilized\" empire and these tribes. For the tribes, can you go more into detail on their physical appearance? Specifically, how would their skin color or features reflect that more \"animalistic\" or \"less evolved\" vibe compared to my main characters? I want them to look fundamentally different in a way that makes them feel more like a force of nature rather than just people.",
